{"id":"2aa5dabf3bcc59a6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/042_命题依赖逻辑_PDL_dep.md","title":"042 命题依赖逻辑 PDL dep","display":"042_命题依赖逻辑_PDL_dep","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>修订状态：repair-candidate。原审查评级仅针对备份的原始字节；本稿为授权修复候选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令命题变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pos},\\operatorname{negp},\\operatorname{dep},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pos},\\operatorname{negp},\\operatorname{dep},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{negp}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{negp}(p)\\)</span> 只是否定文字构造子；没有作用于任意公式的否定构造子。新增原子写作：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dep}(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1};q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dep}(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1};q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式与自由变元\">2. 公式与自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义依赖指标集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DepIdx}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Prop}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{DepIdx}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Prop}^{n}\\times\\mathsf{Prop}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pos}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\operatorname{pos}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{negp}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\operatorname{negp}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\alpha,q)\\in\\mathsf{DepIdx}\">\\((\\alpha,q)\\in\\mathsf{DepIdx}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:n\\to\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(\\alpha:n\\to\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>自由变元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{pos}(p))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{negp}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{pos}(p))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{negp}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q))\n=\n\\operatorname{rng}(\\alpha)\\cup\\{q\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q))\n=\n\\operatorname{rng}(\\alpha)\\cup\\{q\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-命题重命名与无绑定约定\">3. 命题重命名与无绑定约定</h1>\n<p>命题重命名集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep}\n=\n\\{\\rho:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Prop}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep}\n=\n\\{\\rho:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Prop}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>，其扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho:\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\widehat\\rho:\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{pos}(p))=\\operatorname{pos}(\\rho(p)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{negp}(p))=\\operatorname{negp}(\\rho(p)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{pos}(p))=\\operatorname{pos}(\\rho(p)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{negp}(p))=\\operatorname{negp}(\\rho(p)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q))\n=\n\\operatorname{dep}(\\rho\\circ\\alpha;\\rho(q)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q))\n=\n\\operatorname{dep}(\\rho\\circ\\alpha;\\rho(q)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\rho(A),\\widehat\\rho(B)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\rho(A),\\widehat\\rho(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\rho(A),\\widehat\\rho(B)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\rho(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\rho(A),\\widehat\\rho(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{RenAct}_{PDLdep}(A,\\rho)=\\widehat\\rho(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{RenAct}_{PDLdep}(A,\\rho)=\\widehat\\rho(A)\\)</span>。本系统没有绑定构造子，故</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{PDLdep}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_\\alpha^{PDLdep}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{PDLdep}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_\\alpha^{PDLdep}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-团队对象\">4. 团队对象</h1>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，赋值是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(s:V\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。命题团队是集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)=\\{X:X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}=\\{(V,X):V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop},X\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)=\\{X:X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}=\\{(V,X):V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop},X\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in V\">\\(p\\in V\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(p)\">\\(s(p)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 在赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 下的值。团队分割谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Split}(X,Y,Z)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nY\\cup Z=X\\wedge Y\\subseteq X\\wedge Z\\subseteq X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Split}(X,Y,Z)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nY\\cup Z=X\\wedge Y\\subseteq X\\wedge Z\\subseteq X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec p=(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1})\">\\(\\vec p=(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1})\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(\\vec p)=s&#39;(\\vec p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(p_i)=s&#39;(p_i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(\\vec p)=s&#39;(\\vec p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(p_i)=s&#39;(p_i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-满足关系\">5. 满足关系</h1>\n<p>满足关系的类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\models_{PDLdep}\n\\ \\subseteq\\ \n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\models_{PDLdep}\n\\ \\subseteq\\ \n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop}(V)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq V\\)</span> 时，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A\">\\((V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A\\)</span>，并定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{pos}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in X\\ s(p)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{pos}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in X\\ s(p)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{negp}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in X\\ s(p)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{negp}(p)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in X\\ s(p)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,s&#39;\\in X\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(\\alpha(i))=s&#39;(\\alpha(i)))\\Rightarrow s(q)=s&#39;(q)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,s&#39;\\in X\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(\\alpha(i))=s&#39;(\\alpha(i)))\\Rightarrow s(q)=s&#39;(q)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(V,X)\\models A\\wedge (V,X)\\models B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n(V,X)\\models A\\wedge (V,X)\\models B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Y,Z(\\operatorname{Split}(X,Y,Z)\\wedge (V,Y)\\models A\\wedge (V,Z)\\models B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(V,X)\\models\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists Y,Z(\\operatorname{Split}(X,Y,Z)\\wedge (V,Y)\\models A\\wedge (V,Z)\\models B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-后承关系\">6. 后承关系</h1>\n<p>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep}\\)</span>；任意前提集都可取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(V=\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 覆盖其全部自由名。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{PDLdep}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{PDLdep}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(V\\subseteq\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\supseteq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}}\\operatorname{FV}(B)\">\\(V\\supseteq\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma\\cup\\{A\\}}\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\)</span> 与所有团队 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}B\\bigr)\\Rightarrow (V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}B\\bigr)\\Rightarrow (V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证书对象\">7. 证书对象</h1>\n<p>证书节点载体保留有限命题域，定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}\n=\n\\{((V,Y),B):(V,Y)\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\\ V\\subseteq_{fin}\\mathsf{Prop},\\ B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep},\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}\n=\n\\{((V,Y),B):(V,Y)\\in\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\\ V\\subseteq_{fin}\\mathsf{Prop},\\ B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep},\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(B)\\subseteq V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证书节点许可关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\times\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>许可关系<strong>恰为</strong>下面三族零前提规则和两族二前提规则的并；所有显示前提/结论均须在 CertState 中。其他前提长度、结论形状或状态组合一律不属于此关系。叶规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{pos}(p)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in Y\\,s(p)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{pos}(p)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in Y\\,s(p)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{negp}(p)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in Y\\,s(p)=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{negp}(p)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s\\in Y\\,s(p)=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,s&#39;\\in Y\\,\n\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(\\alpha(i))=s&#39;(\\alpha(i)))\\Rightarrow s(q)=s&#39;(q)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((),((V,Y),\\operatorname{dep}(\\alpha;q)))\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall s,s&#39;\\in Y\\,\n\\bigl((\\forall i&lt;n\\ s(\\alpha(i))=s&#39;(\\alpha(i)))\\Rightarrow s(q)=s&#39;(q)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>复合规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((((V,Y),C),((V,Y),D)),((V,Y),\\operatorname{and}(C,D)))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((((V,Y),C),((V,Y),D)),((V,Y),\\operatorname{and}(C,D)))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((((V,Y_0),C),((V,Y_1),D)),((V,Y),\\operatorname{or}(C,D)))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Split}(Y,Y_0,Y_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((((V,Y_0),C),((V,Y_1),D)),((V,Y),\\operatorname{or}(C,D)))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Split}(Y,Y_0,Y_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限节点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 与边关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\">\\(\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec}(u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists q:m\\to N\\,\n\\bigl(q(0)=u\\land q(m-1)=v\\land\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec}(u,v)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\ \\exists q:m\\to N\\,\n\\bigl(q(0)=u\\land q(m-1)=v\\land\n\\forall i+1&lt;m\\ q(i)\\prec q(i+1)\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)=\\{v\\in N:u\\prec v\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)=\\{v\\in N:u\\prec v\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>有限证书树谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nN\\ne\\varnothing\\land N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\\land\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in N\\ \\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec}(r,v)\n\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in N\\ (u\\prec r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in N\\setminus\\{r\\}\\ \\exists!u\\in N\\ (u\\prec v)\n\\land\\lambda:N\\to\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{rng}(e)=\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall i,j&lt;m\\,(e(i)=e(j)\\Rightarrow i=j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n((\\lambda(e(0)),\\ldots,\\lambda(e(m-1))),\\lambda(u))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\\\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\nN\\ne\\varnothing\\land N\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathbb N\n\\land r\\in N\\land\\prec\\subseteq N\\times N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in N\\ \\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec}(r,v)\n\\land\\neg\\exists u\\in N\\ (u\\prec r)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in N\\setminus\\{r\\}\\ \\exists!u\\in N\\ (u\\prec v)\n\\land\\lambda:N\\to\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall u\\in N\\ \\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:m\\to\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)\\,\n\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{rng}(e)=\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec}(u)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall i,j&lt;m\\,(e(i)=e(j)\\Rightarrow i=j)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\n((\\lambda(e(0)),\\ldots,\\lambda(e(m-1))),\\lambda(u))\n\\in\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep}\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span> 时前提列为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。满足证书关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\land\\lambda(r)=((V,X),A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists N\\,\\exists r\\,\\exists\\prec\\,\\exists\\lambda\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep}(N,r,\\prec,\\lambda)\n\\land\\lambda(r)=((V,X),A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^{V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\subseteq V\\)</span>，公式高度归纳给出</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\\Longleftrightarrow(V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\\Longleftrightarrow(V,X)\\models_{PDLdep}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正向沿实际有限树许可归纳，反向沿公式高度把见证分裂接为两个互不交子树；原子叶用对应的零前提族。有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 及叶检查的赋值表有限。此桥只声明于有限输入；任意变量域上的 TeamSat 不调用有限证书。</p>\n<p>记有类型满足与后承谓词分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TeamSat}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\">\\(\\operatorname{TeamSat}_{PDLdep}((V,X),A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conseq}_{PDLdep}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conseq}_{PDLdep}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>，它们分别是第 5、6 节定义的关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{PDLdep}\">\\(\\models_{PDLdep}\\)</span> 依据左输入类型显示相应关系，团队左输入是有标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,X)\">\\((V,X)\\)</span>，后承左输入为公式集。二者载体不同，空团队仍有显式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{PDLdep}\n=\n(\\operatorname{dep},\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\\operatorname{Split},\\models_{PDLdep}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_{PDLdep}\n=\n(\\operatorname{dep},\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\\operatorname{Split},\\models_{PDLdep}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dep}\">\\(\\operatorname{dep}\\)</span> 的满足条款要求同一团队中在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 上一致的两个赋值也在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 上一致；删除该条款即删除本系统的依赖机制。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PDLdep}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{DepIdx},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{RenAct}_{PDLdep},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\n\\operatorname{Split},\n\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec},\n\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{TeamSat}_{PDLdep},\\operatorname{Conseq}_{PDLdep},\\models_{PDLdep},\n\\Delta_{PDLdep}\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PDLdep}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{DepIdx},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{Ren}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{RenAct}_{PDLdep},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{Team}_{Prop},\n\\operatorname{Split},\n\\mathsf{CertState}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{Reach}_{\\prec},\n\\operatorname{Child}_{\\prec},\n\\mathsf{CertRule}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{CertTree}_{PDLdep},\n\\mathsf{SatCert}_{PDLdep},\n\\operatorname{TeamSat}_{PDLdep},\\operatorname{Conseq}_{PDLdep},\\models_{PDLdep},\n\\Delta_{PDLdep}\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含命题依赖原子、团队分割满足和语义后承；不含复合否定、一阶量词、Kripke 结构或 Hilbert 证明对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与自由变元","text":"2. 公式与自由变元","level":1},{"id":"3.-命题重命名与无绑定约定","text":"3. 命题重命名与无绑定约定","level":1},{"id":"4.-团队对象","text":"4. 团队对象","level":1},{"id":"5.-满足关系","text":"5. 满足关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-后承关系","text":"6. 后承关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证书对象","text":"7. 证书对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pos},\\operatorname{negp},\\operatorname{dep},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{negp}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dep}(p_0,\\ldots,p_{n-1};q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DepIdx}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Prop}^{n}\\times\\maths